%F A402477 G.f.: Sum_{k>=1} Product_{j=1..k} x^j/((1 - x^(3*j))*(1 - x^(3*j-1))*(1 - x^(3*j-2))).
%F A402477 a(n) ~ c * d^sqrt(n) / n^(3/4), where d = 9.71883916658779687317137071... and c = 0.145143875256750168002872...
%t A402477 nmax = 60; CoefficientList[Series[Sum[x^(k*(k+1)/2)/Product[1-x^j, {j, 1, 3*k}], {k, 1, Sqrt[2*nmax]}], {x, 0, nmax}], x]
